            ("Can weak signal look full?", "Yes. Interference and roaming can disrupt traffic despite reasonable bars. Test close to one access point while stationary."),
            ("Should I reset the network?", "Not first. It removes saved adapters and settings. A time/location/other-device comparison usually gives a safer, narrower next step."),
            ("Why does only one router cause drops?", "Band, security, roaming, firmware, channel conditions, or compatibility may differ. Preserve the PC if it is stable on other trusted networks."),
            ("Do I need a new Wi-Fi adapter?", "Only after supported driver, multiple-network, signal, and hardware-status tests point to it. A router-wide outage or weak coverage will not be fixed by replacement."),
