            ("Adapter has a Device Manager code", "Use that exact code and model with Windows Update and the PC maker's official guidance."),
            ("Wi-Fi and Bluetooth both disappear", "A shared module, power transition, firmware, or hardware path may be involved."),
            ("Adapter is healthy but the button is missing", "Focus on Windows UI, service, policy, or profile behavior rather than replacing hardware."),
